{"type": "objection", "id": "ob_f9dc075c", "criterion_id": "freq", "text": "While the documentation confirms only 2 prior injections in the past 12 months, it completely omits the clinical response, percentage of pain relief, and duration of relief obtained from the 10/16/2025 and 01/02/2026 injections. Evidence of efficacy from prior injections is required to justify subsequent epidural steroid injections.", "severity": "high", "ts": "2026-10-12T21:52:54.531+00:00"}
{"type": "objection", "id": "ob_59b9d4ce", "criterion_id": "dur.conservative", "text": "The cited quote for physical therapy (04/16/2026 to 05/14/2026) lacks specific details regarding the frequency of sessions and the actual modalities used. Furthermore, there is no documentation of a trial of conservative pharmacological management (e.g., NSAIDs, membrane stabilizers) to constitute a comprehensive conservative care plan.", "severity": "high", "ts": "2026-10-12T21:52:54.531+00:00"}
{"type": "objection", "id": "ob_fde0fc78", "criterion_id": "sev.baseline", "text": "The baseline NRS score of 9/10 does not specify whether it measures the axial low back pain or the radicular leg pain. For an epidural steroid injection targeting radiculopathy, the objective pain scale must specifically reflect the severity of the radicular symptoms.", "severity": "medium", "ts": "2026-10-12T21:52:54.531+00:00"}
{"type": "objection", "id": "ob_24f4452c", "criterion_id": "contra", "text": "The documentation notes 'afebrile' and 'no red flags', but fails to explicitly rule out a local skin infection at the planned injection site or coagulopathy/bleeding disorders, which are standard absolute contraindications for epidural steroid injections.", "severity": "medium", "ts": "2026-10-12T21:52:54.531+00:00"}
{"type": "objection", "id": "ob_7c3adff3", "criterion_id": "rehab", "text": "The statement 'Continues the daily home exercise program taught in PT' is vague. It lacks details on the specific exercises, duration, and objective evidence of patient compliance to verify active participation in a functional restoration program.", "severity": "low", "ts": "2026-10-12T21:52:54.531+00:00"}
{"type": "objection_update", "id": "ob_24f4452c", "status": "conceded", "rebuttal": "The chart does not explicitly document absence of local skin infection at the injection site or absence of coagulopathy/bleeding disorders. This documentation is missing.", "citations": [], "ts": "2026-10-12T21:53:04.218+00:00"}
{"type": "objection_update", "id": "ob_59b9d4ce", "status": "rebutted", "rebuttal": "The chart documents a 4-week structured physical therapy program and failed trial of ibuprofen 600 mg TID, meeting the requirement for noninvasive conservative care including pharmacological management.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "08f3f293-b1de-4b5b-8a52-f5fd8d85e7ea", "quote": "The patient underwent a structured physical therapy program focusing on mobility and strengthening exercises.\n\nOutcome:\nCompleted physical therapy from 04/16/2026 to 05/14/2026 (4 weeks) with no lasting benefit, and failed ibuprofen 600 mg TID.", "start": 390, "end": 634, "verified": true}], "ts": "2026-10-12T21:53:07.942+00:00"}
